{"pageid":3832,"title":"Acid Crown","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Acid Crown</span>","revid":17381,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Acid_Crown\">Acid Crown</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Acid Crown</b> is a quest item and equipment item dropped exclusively from the <a href=\"/wiki/Skeleton_King\" title=\"Skeleton King\">Skeleton King</a> located in his arena near the back of the <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a>. It serves no purpose other than to complete the Goblin arena Quest to start the trial.  \n</p><p>Similar to that of other worn equipment items like the <a href=\"/wiki/Miner%27s_Helmet\" title=\"Miner&#39;s Helmet\">Miners Helmet</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Scooba_Tank\" title=\"Refined Scooba Tank\">Refined Scooba Tank</a>, it can be worn and seen on the players avatar when equipped. \n</p><p>After you complete the Goblin arena Quest, you won't be needing to wear acid crown anymore in order to enter the goblin shops. As well you can rematch the arena without using the acid crown.  \n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Acid Crown</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/35/Acid_Crown.png/revision/latest?cb=20250211002520\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Acid Crown\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/35/Acid_Crown.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250211002520\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/35/Acid_Crown.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250211002520 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/3/35/Acid_Crown.png/revision/latest?cb=202502